//www.newsis.com/view/NISX20261020_0003834000","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Newsis","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"[속보]역삼동 빌딩 방화 용의자 “특허법인에서 사기쳐서 방화” 주장","title_en":"[Update] The suspect in the fire of the 3rd building claims \"patent fraud and fire\"","summary":"20일 서울 강남구 역삼동 한 건물에서 화재가 발생해 소방관들이 잔해를 정리하고 있다. 2026.10.20. 정효진 기자서울 강남구 역삼동 빌딩 2곳에 방화한 혐의를 받는 70대 남성 A씨가 “특허법인에서 사기를 쳐서 (방화를 했다)”고 밝혔다.A씨는 20일 방화 후 도주했다가 서울 종로구 지하철 1호선 동묘역앞 인근에서 검거됐다. A씨는 서울수서경찰서로 ···","summary_en":"A fire broke out in a building in Gangnam-gu, Seoul on October 20. Firefighters are clearing the debris from the fire. 2026.10.20. Kim Hyeon JinA man of about 70 years old who was accused of setting fire to two buildings in Gangnam district's Stasan-dong area said he \"caught fire because I was scammed by a patent company.\" He fled after the fire and was arrested near Dongmyeong station on Songro metro line 1 in Seoul on October ...","date":"2026-10-20T09:30","link":"https://www.khan.co.kr/article/202610201830001/?utm_source=khan_rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=total_news","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Kyunghyang Shinmun","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"Gov’t Designates 10-day Countermeasures Period to Manage Halloween Crowds","title_en":"Gov’t Designates 10-day Countermeasures Period to Manage Halloween Crowds","summary":"[Domestic] : The government has reviewed safety management measures for major areas that are set to drawn huge crowds around Halloween, which falls on Saturday of next week. The Ministry of the Interior and Safety said it convened a meeting of related agencies, chaired by Ministe","summary_en":"[Domestic] : The government has reviewed safety management measures for major areas that are set to drawn huge crowds around Halloween, which falls on Saturday of next week. The Ministry of the Interior and Safety said it convened a meeting of related agencies, chaired by Ministe","date":"2026-10-20T09:30","link":"https://world.kbs.co.kr/service/news_view.htm?lang=e&Seq_Code=204999","outlet":"KBS World","lang":"en","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"national","first_seen":"2026-10-20 10:17Z"},{"title":"러 위성, 美 상업위성에 초근접…\"첩보·교란·파괴 등 가능성\"","title_en":"Russian satellite, ultra-close to US commercial satellite... \"intelligence, interference and destruction possibilities\"","summary":"[서울=뉴시스]신정원 기자 = 러시아 위성이 우크라이나군 지원에 활용될 수 있는 미국 상업 위성에 500m 거리까지 접근한 것으로 나타났다. 전문가들은 위성 정보 수집이나 통신 교란을 시도했을 가능성을 주시하고 있다. 미국 CNN과 뉴욕타임스(NYT) 등에 따르면 러시아 위성 '코스모스 2612'는 지난 15일부터 핀란드 기업 아이스아이가 운용하는 관측 위성 'ICEYE-X36'에 접근했다. 아이스아이는 미국 등에 자회사를 두고 있으며, ICEYE-X36은 미국 위성으로 등록돼 있다. 당초 350","summary_en":"[Seoul] Sin Jeong-won = A Russian satellite has been able to approach a U.S. commercial satellite that could be used in support of the Ukrainian military up to 500 meters away, experts say. Experts are watching for possible attempts at gathering information or interfering with communications. According to CNN and The New York Times (NYT), Russia's Cosmos 2612 satellite was able to access an observation satellite operated by Finnish company IceEye on June 15.","date":"2026-10-20T09:28","link":"https://www.newsis.com/view/NISX20261020_0003833749","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Newsis","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"“캠핑 다녀온 뒤 열 나네”…혹시 감기 아닌 ‘이것’?","title_en":"\"I'm not a cold, I'm just having a fever after camping.\"","summary":"열이 나고 몸살 기운이 있으면 감기나 독감을 먼저 떠올리기 쉽다. 하지만 야외활동 후 발열이 나타났다면 가을철 열성질환도 의심해야 한다.가을철을 맞아 등산이나 캠핑, 농작업 등 야외활동이 늘면서 진드기나 설치류를 통해 감염되는 열성질환 의심 환자도 늘고 있다. 20일 의료계에 따르면 대표적인 열성질환에는 쯔쯔가무시증, 중증열성혈소판감소증후군(SFTS), 신증후군출혈열, 렙토스피라증 등이 있다. 이들 질환은 초기 증상이 발열, 오한, 두통, 근육통 등으로 감기와 비슷해 최근 야외활동 여부를 의료진에","summary_en":"When you have a fever and energy, it's easy to think of a cold or the flu first. However, if you have a fever after outdoor activities, you should also suspect a febrile disease in the fall. As outdoor activities such as hiking, camping, and agricultural work increase in the autumn season, more people are suspected of having febrile diseases infected with ticks or rodents. According to the medical community on the 20th, typical febrile diseases include Zschmyssia, severe febrile thrombocytopenia syndrome (SFTS), renal syndrome hemorrhagic fever, and leptospirosis. These diseases are similar to colds because the initial symptoms are fever, chills, headache, muscle pain, etc.","date":"2026-10-20T09:26","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Society/article/all/20261020/134877493/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"“아무나 KAI 가질 수 없다”… 한화 경영 참여 견제한 김종출 사장","title_en":"\"Nobody can have KAI\"... Chairman Kim Jong-ut, who has been a challenge to Hanwha's management participation","summary":"김종출 한국항공우주산업(KAI) 사장이 20일 “누구나 KAI를 갖고 싶어 하지만 아무나 KAI를 가질 수 없다”고 말했다. 한화그룹이 KAI 지분을 확대하며 경영 참여를 추진하는 데 대해 견제에 나선 것이다. 김 사장은 이날 국회 재정경제기획위원회 국정감사에서 한화그룹의 KAI 지분 확대와 관련해 직원들에게 전할 말을 묻는 강민국 국민의힘 의원의 질의에","summary_en":"“Everyone wants to have Kai, but no one can have Kai,” Kim Jong-joon, president of Korean Aerospace Industries (Kai), said on the 20th. Hanwha Group expanded its stake in Kai and acted as a deterrent to promoting management participation. During the National Audit of the Fiscal and Economic Planning Committee of the National Assembly, Kim asked the inquiry of the member of the People's Strength Committee of the Republic of Korea, who asked what he would say to employees regarding the expansion of Hanwha Group's stake in Kai.","date":"2026-10-20T09:26","link":"https://www.chosun.com/economy/industry-company/2026/10/20/MVRWKYTBMZRDMZJUHFRWMZRTMQ/","outlet":"Chosun Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"N. Korea vows 'tit-for-tat' action against S. Korea-U.S. military exercise","title_en":"N. Korea vows 'tit-for-tat' action against S. Korea-U.S. military exercise","summary":"SEOUL, Oct. 20 (Yonhap) -- North Korea on Tuesday denounced South Korea's ongoin...","summary_en":"SEOUL, Oct. 20 (Yonhap) -- North Korea on Tuesday denounced South Korea's ongoin...","date":"2026-10-20T09:24","link":"https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261020009600315","outlet":"Yonhap News (English, North Korea)","lang":"en","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"national","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"[속보]'역삼 연쇄방화' 70대 \"특허법인서 사기 쳐서 범행…3일전부터 준비\"","title_en":"[Update] 'Stream of the River' 70s \"Patent fraud and crime... prepared three days ago\"","summary":"[서울=뉴시스]","summary_en":"[Seoul = NewsSide]","date":"2026-10-20T09:23","link":"https://www.newsis.com/view/NISX20261020_0003834001","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Newsis","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"“미군 박살내자”…오산기지 침입 대진연 3명 집유","title_en":"\"The Americans are the ones who have to be killed.\"","summary":"경기 평택시 주한미군 오산공군기지(K-55)에 무단 침입해 구호를 외친 혐의로 기소된 한국대학생진보연합(대진연) 소속 대학생 3명이 1심에서 징역형의 집행유예를 선고받았다.20일 수원지법 평택지원 형사5단독 김규화 판사는 군사기지 및 군사시설 보호법 위반 등 혐의로 기소된 대진연 소속 회원 등 3명에게 징역 6월에 집행유예 2년을 각각 선고했다.재판부는 “피고인들은 미군이 호남반도체 산업단지 건설을 방해한다는 생각에 항의하기 위해 주한미군기지에 무단으로 공동침입했다”며 “자신들의 의사를 효과적으로","summary_en":"Three university students from the Korea University Student Advancement Union (Daejinyeon) charged with trespassing and shouting slogans at Osan Air Base (K-55), Pyeongtaek-si, Gyeonggi-do have been sentenced to suspended prison sentences in the first trial.20 days Suwon District Law Detective Pyeongtaek Support5Judge Kim Kyuhwa alone sentenced three members of Daejinyeon to suspended prison sentences in June, including three members of Daejinyeon who were charged with violating the Military Base and Military Facility Protection Act. “The defendants unauthorizedly intruded on the US military base in Korea to protest against the idea that the US military was interfering with the construction of the Honam semiconductor industrial complex,” the tribunal said.","date":"2026-10-20T09:23","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Society/article/all/20261020/134877466/2","geo":{"n":"Osan","la":37.152,"lo":127.071,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"‘재정 빨대’ 추미애, 소방노조 만나 사과…“잘못된 단어로 상처”","title_en":"\"There is no way to know the truth about the fire.\"","summary":"추미애 경기도지사가 이른바 ‘소방 재정 빨대’ 발언으로 논란을 빚은 데 대해 소방공무원 노동조합에 다시 사과했다. 노조는 사과를 받아들이면서도 인력 부족과 장시간 근무 등 현장의 구조적 문제를 해결해야 한다고 촉구했다. 고 김진석 소방위 순직 사고의 진상 규명과 책임자 문책도 요구했다.추 지사는 20일 오후 일정을 조정해 경기도청 집무실에서 소방노조 관계자들과 만났다. 이 자리에서 “저의 불찰로 표현상 잘못된 단어 때문에 마음의 상처가 컸다면 진심으로 사과드린다”라며 고개를 숙였다. 이어 “이 문","summary_en":"Gyeonggi-do Chumiae apologized again to the fire officials’ trade union for causing controversy over his so-called \"fire finance straw\" remark. While accepting the apology, the union urged to address structural problems in the field, such as manpower shortages and long hours. Kim Jin-seok, the high commissioner of firefighting, also demanded to find out the truth of the accident and blame the person in charge. Chu rescheduled his schedule for the afternoon of the 20th to meet with fire union officials at the Gyeonggi Provincial Office. Here, he bowed his head, saying, \"I sincerely apologize if my heart was hurt by the wrong word in the expression.\" Then, “This door","date":"2026-10-20T09:22","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Society/article/all/20261020/134877380/1","geo":{"n":"Gyeonggi-do","la":37.447,"lo":126.98,"p":"province"},"outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"[속보] 역삼방화 70대, 범행 동기 묻자 \"특허법인이 사기쳐\" 주장","title_en":"[Update] 70-year-old man from Tangshan, China accused of \"patent fraud\" when asked about his motives for the crime","summary":"(","summary_en":"(","date":"2026-10-20T09:21","link":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261020162800004","outlet":"Yonhap News (society)","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"러 교육장관 방북, AI 협력 등 논의…러시아어 교육센터 개설","title_en":"Russian Education Minister Visits North Korea, Discuss AI Cooperation and Other Issues...","summary":"세르게이 크라프초프 러시아 교육부 장관이 19일(현지시간) 평양을 방문해 리영철 북한 교육상과 회담했다고 타스통신 등이 보도했다.크라프초프 장관의 방북은 지난해 양국이 교육협정을 체결하고 협력 확대에 합의한 데 따른 것으로, 이번 회담에서는 인공지능(AI) 및 교육 분야의 협력을 더욱 강화하기로 뜻을 모은 것으로 전해졌다. 러시아 교육부 공보실은 성명에서 “크라프초프 장관이 평양 인민문화궁전에서 리영철 북한 교육상과 양자 회담을 열고 러시아어 교육, 자질 교육 및 인공지능 분야의 경험 교류 등 교","summary_en":"Russian Education Minister Sergey Kravtsov visited Pyongyang on the 19th (local time) to meet with the North Korean Education Prize leader, Tas reported. Kravtsov's visit follows the signing of an education agreement and an agreement to expand cooperation between the two countries last year, and the talks reportedly aimed to further strengthen cooperation in the field of artificial intelligence (AI) and education. In a statement, the Russian Ministry of Education's Office of Public Affairs said, “Minister Kravtsov held bilateral talks with the North Korean education prize Riyoungcheol at the Pyongyang People's Cultural Palace and held discussions on the exchange of experience in the field of Russian language education, qualification education, and artificial intelligence.","date":"2026-10-20T09:20","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Politics/article/all/20261020/134877452/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"[여적]‘살상 무기’ 최루탄","title_en":"[Women] 'weapon of killing'","summary":"프랑스 학생들이 지난 7일 파리에서 열악한 교육 환경 개선과 교육 예산 확충 등을 요구하며 시위하고 있다. Gettyimages/이매진스1960년 4월11일 오전 11시30분쯤 경남 마산 중앙부두 앞바다에 눈에 최루탄이 박힌 시신 한 구가 떠올랐다. 이승만 자유당 정권이 27일 전인 3월15일 자행한 부정선거에 항의해 일어난 시위 도중 실종됐던 만 15세의···","summary_en":"French students are protesting in Paris on the 7th, demanding improvements to the poor educational environment and increasing education budgets. Gettyimages/Imagine Around 11:30 a.m. on April 11, 1960, a dead body with tear gas embedded in its eyes appeared on the offshore of the central pier in Masan, Gyeongsangnam-do. Lee Seung-man, a 15-year-old who disappeared during a protest against the fraudulent election held 27 days ago on March 15, · · ·","date":"2026-10-20T09:20","link":"https://www.khan.co.kr/article/202610201820001/?utm_source=khan_rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=total_news","geo":{"n":"Gyeongsangnam-do","la":35.194,"lo":128.68,"p":"province"},"outlet":"Kyunghyang Shinmun","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"Wednesday to Bring Rain, Cold Temperatures","title_en":"Wednesday to Bring Rain, Cold Temperatures","summary":"[Domestic] : Many parts of the country are set to see rain and a sharp drop in temperatures on Wednesday. According to the Korea Meteorological Administration on Tuesday, up to 40 millimeters of rain will fall on the Gyeongsang provinces and Jeju Island on Wednesday morning. The ","summary_en":"[Domestic] : Many parts of the country are set to see rain and a sharp drop in temperatures on Wednesday. According to the Korea Meteorological Administration on Tuesday, up to 40 millimeters of rain will fall on the Gyeongsang provinces and Jeju Island on Wednesday morning. The ","date":"2026-10-20T09:15","link":"https://world.kbs.co.kr/service/news_view.htm?lang=e&Seq_Code=204998","outlet":"KBS World","lang":"en","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"national","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:53Z"},{"title":"[속보] '역삼동 빌딩 연쇄방화' 70대 남성 피의자, 경찰서 도착","title_en":"[Update] 'Shangdong Building Chain Fire' 70-year-old man suspect, arrived at police station","summary":"[서울=뉴시스]","summary_en":"[Seoul = NewsSide]","date":"2026-10-20T09:15","link":"https://www.newsis.com/view/NISX20261020_0003833870","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Newsis","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-20 09:39Z"},{"title":"'비화폰 삭제' 박종준 前 경호처장, 1심 무죄→2심 징역 1년에 상고","title_en":"Former security chief Park Sung-joon, acquitted at first instance and sentenced to one year in prison at second instance","summary":"[서울=뉴시스] 오정우 기자 = 12·3 비상계엄 이후 주요 관련자들의 비화폰 정보를 삭제한 혐의로 1심에서 무죄를 받았으나 항소심에서 유죄를 선고받은 박종준 전 대통령경호처장이 불복해 상고했다. 20일 법조계에 따르면 박 전 처장 측은 이날 증거인멸 혐의 항소심을 심리한 서울고법 형사12-2부(고법판사 조진구·김민아·이승철)에 상고장을 제출했다. 앞서 2심은 14일 원심의 무죄 판결을 뒤집고 징역 1년을 선고했다. 박 전 처장은 계엄 이후인 2024년 12월 6일 윤 전 대통령과 홍 전 국가정보","summary_en":"[Seoul = Newsis] Reporter Oh Jeong-woo = After the 12/3 emergency martial law, Park Jong-joon, the former head of the Presidential Security Service, who was acquitted in the first instance of deleting the non-handphone information of the main stakeholders, was convicted on appeal and appealed. According to the legal system on the 20th, Park submitted an appeal to Criminal Section 12-2 of the Seoul High Court (High Court Judge Cho Jingu, Kim M