//www.newsis.com/view/NISX20261018_0003830535","geo":{"n":"Seoul","la":37.566,"lo":126.978,"p":"approx"},"outlet":"Newsis","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"경기 가평에 호우주의보","title_en":"The game is in progress.","summary":"(의정부=연합뉴스) 기상청은 18일 오후 4시 30분을 기해 가평에 호우주의보를 발효한다고 밝혔다.","summary_en":"The 18th of April at 4:30 p.m., the weather agency announced that a warning was issued for Gaewon.","date":"2026-10-18T07:34","link":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261018041400527","outlet":"Yonhap News (society)","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"의료기관 해킹 90%는 병·의원…보안관제 가입률은 0.007%","title_en":"90% of medical hacking is patients and doctors... security system subscription rate is . 007%","summary":"올해 의료기관 해킹 사고 10건 중 9건은 병·의원급 의료기관에서 발생했지만 정부 보안관제 서비스에 가입한 곳은 0.007%에 불과한 것으로 나타났다. 해킹 피해가 중소 병·의원에 집중되지만 보안 체계는 여전히 취약하다는 지적이 나온다.18일 국회 보건복지위원회 소속 소병훈 더불어민주당 의원이 한국사회보장정보원에서 받은 자료에 따르면 올해 1~9월 민간 의료기관에서 발생한 사이버 침해 사고는 28건으로 집계됐다. 이 가운데 병원에서 17건, 의원에서 8건이 발생해 해킹 공격의 89%가 중소 의료기","summary_en":"This year, 9 out of 10 hacking incidents in medical institutions occurred at hospital and doctor-level healthcare facilities. However, only 0.007% of these have subscribed to the government security control system service. Hacking victims are concentrated on smaller patients and doctors, but there is a warning that their security systems remain vulnerable. According to data received by Sobinhun (DPP) Member of Parliament for Health Welfare Committee from Korea Social Security Information Agency on January 18, 28 cyber breaches were reported in private health care facilities between January and September this year.","date":"2026-10-18T07:33","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Society/article/all/20261018/134860705/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"‘청년 대통령’ 마크롱의 씁쓸한 퇴장···프랑스 청년들, 임기말 거리로","title_en":"French youths take to the streets at the end of Macron's term as \"young president\"","summary":"17일(현지시간) 열악한 교육 환경과 생활비 부담에 항의하며 벌어진 프랑스 리옹의 시위 현장에서 한 시위 참가자가 불타는 관광 안내소 앞에서 에마뉘엘 마크롱 프랑스 대통령의 사진이 담긴 피켓을 들고 있다. AP연합뉴스2017년 39세의 나이로 프랑스 최연소 대통령에 당선돼 ‘세대교체’와 정치적 쇄신의 상징으로 떠올랐던 에마뉘엘 마크롱 대통령이 임기 말 청년···","summary_en":"A protester holds a picket with a photo of French President Emmanuel Macron in front of a burning tourist information office at a protest in Lyon, France, on the 17th (local time) in protest against poor educational conditions and the cost of living. AP Yonhap NewsPresident Emmanuel Macron, who was elected the youngest president of France in 2017 at the age of 39 and emerged as a symbol of ’generational change’ and political renewal at the end of his term as a young man...","date":"2026-10-18T07:32","link":"https://www.khan.co.kr/article/202610181632001/?utm_source=khan_rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=total_news","outlet":"Kyunghyang Shinmun","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"민주당 “조희대 탄핵사유 차고 넘쳐…자진 사퇴 결단하라”","title_en":"\"There is no reason to be afraid of the future.\"","summary":"더불어민주당이 18일 조희대 대법원장을 향해 “차고 넘치는 탄핵사유로 국민적 심판은 이미 끝났다”며 “자진 사퇴를 기다리는 국민의 인내에도 한계가 있다. 조 대법원장의 신속한 결단을 촉구한다”고 밝혔다. 민주당 이용우 대변인은 이날 국회에서 브리핑을 통해 “대한민국의 근간을 흔드는 부도덕한 대법원장은 더 이상 국민이 용납하지 않는다”며 이같이 말했다. 그는 “조 대법원장의 헌법과 법률 위반, 부도덕한 행태는 차고 넘친다”며 조 대법원장의 재제청 거부 선언, 국회의 합법적인 증인 출석 요구 불응 등","summary_en":"The Democratic Party (DPP) on 18th March called for the Supreme Court President Choi Hye-dae to resign, saying that \"the people's judgment is already over because of a large number of impeachment cases. There are limits to the patience of the nation waiting for his voluntary resignation and we call upon him to take an immediate decision.\" DPP spokesman Lee Yoon-wo said in a briefing at the National Assembly today that \"the citizens will no longer tolerate the immoral Chief Justice who shakes the foundation of the Republic of Korea\". He added that \"The Chief Justice Choi violates the Constitution and laws, and his immoral behaviour is widespread.\"","date":"2026-10-18T07:31","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Politics/article/all/20261018/134861509/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"Kazakh national arrested for threatening driver on street","title_en":"Kazakh national arrested for threatening driver on street","summary":"A 21-year-old Kazakh national was arrested for allegedly blocking a car and damaging it while threatening its driver in Icheon, Gyeonggi Province, police said Saturday. The man allegedly chased a car driven by a man in his 30s at around 11:40 p.m. on July 29. After blocking the c","summary_en":"A 21-year-old Kazakh national was arrested for allegedly blocking a car and damaging it while threatening its driver in Icheon, Gyeonggi Province, police said Saturday. The man allegedly chased a car driven by a man in his 30s at around 11:40 p.m. on July 29. After blocking the c","date":"2026-10-18T07:31","link":"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10906258","outlet":"The Korea Herald","lang":"en","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"national","first_seen":"2026-10-18 07:39Z"},{"title":"태풍 같은 요란한 가을비... 낙엽이 배수구 막아 곳곳 침수","title_en":"The stormy autumn rain... the leaves blocked drainage and flooded everywhere.","date":"2026-10-18T07:30","link":"https://www.chosun.com/national/transport-environment/2026/10/18/J3UNN7INFRAPFGZQHXOISQCU7A/","outlet":"Chosun Ilbo","lang":"ko","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job